<title>FINLAND: Finnish prelim May trade surplus FIM 4.7 bln -NCB.</title>
<headline>Finnish prelim May trade surplus FIM 4.7 bln -NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's preliminary trade surplus rose to 4.70 billion markka in May from 4.28 billion in April and from 4.17 billion in May last year, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The value of exports rose three percent year-on-year in May while the value of imports was unchanged, NCB said.</p>
<p>Preliminary trade balance (million markka):</p>
<p>		   May'97   April'97     May'96</p>
<p> Exports	 16,700     18,207     16,184</p>
<p> Imports	 12,000     13,925     12,010</p>
<p> Balance	 +4,700     +4,282     +4,175</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
